            </note>
            <note corresp="#d394-f2" n="20" xml:id="d394-f2-content">
                <p>Political Consultative Conference. For its resolutions as adopted, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Relations With China</hi>, pp.
                    610–621.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
